{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 3, "ref": "judges 17:3", "book": "judges", "lang": "ha", "chapter": 17, "translation": "Sai ya mayar da ⟨אֵת⟩ ⟨את⟩ azurfar ⟨את⟩ Guda ɗari da goma sha ɗaya ga mahaifiyarsa. Mahaifiyarsa ta ce: «Na cika keɓancewa, na cika keɓatarwa ⟨na keɓanta⟩ ⟨אֵת⟩ wannan azurfar ga Yahweh daga hannuna, don ɗana, don ya sassaƙa siffa gumiɗa da simintin siffar mutum. Saboda haka ni zan mayar da ita gare ka.»", "tokens": [{"surface": "וישב", "gloss": "Sai ya mayar"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "azurfar"}, {"surface": "אלף", "gloss": "Guda"}, {"surface": "ומאה", "gloss": "ɗari"}, {"surface": "הכסף", "gloss": "azurfar"}, {"surface": "לאמו", "gloss": "ga mahaifiyarsa"}, {"surface": "ותאמר", "gloss": "ta ce"}, {"surface": "אמו", "gloss": "Mahaifiyarsa"}, {"surface": "הקדש", "gloss": "Na cika keɓancewa"}, {"surface": "הקדשתי", "gloss": "na cika keɓatarwa ⟨na keɓanta⟩"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "wannan azurfar"}, {"surface": "הכסף", "gloss": "azurfar"}, {"surface": "ליהוה", "gloss": "ga Yahweh"}, {"surface": "מידי", "gloss": "daga hannuna"}, {"surface": "לבני", "gloss": "don ɗana"}, {"surface": "לעשות", "gloss": "don ya sassaƙa"}, {"surface": "פסל", "gloss": "siffa gumiɗa"}, {"surface": "ומסכה", "gloss": "da simintin siffar mutum"}, {"surface": "ועתה", "gloss": "Saboda haka"}, {"surface": "אשיבנו", "gloss": "ni zan mayar da ita"}, {"surface": "לך", "gloss": "gare ka"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-12T08:05:57.435351410Z", "model": "glm-5.2"}